# Morrowind Daedric quests: Boethiah's shrine rebuilt (DA_Boethiah). Boethiah's ruined statue off the Bitter Coast
# asks for its shrine rebuilt (10, 20, 30: "sculptor"). In Caldera the orc Duma gro-Lag offers a statue ("sculptor":
# 40; "I wish for you to recreate the Shrine of Boethiah." 1) for 2000 gold and the book Boethiah's Glory; a player
# already carrying both hands them over at once (60, StartScript ShrineBoethiah), as the line for 60 comes first. After twenty days of work the new statue stands on Khartag Point and
# gives Goldbrand (70, DaedraBoethiah2).
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel, the AddItem of gold for money the player earned, take for buying
# the book at Jobasha's, waiting for the days passing. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 0537637E the ruined
# statue, 05ABDC44 the book, 053DD7C8 the rebuilt statue.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_da_mephala_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case da_boethiah_start
run
player->Position -65652 -26700 -1900 0
wait 120
activate 0537637E
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Boethiah == 30
end

case da_boethiah_duma
run
player->AddItem Gold_001 2000
player->PositionCell 644 -250 -385 0 "Vivec, Jobasha's Rare Books"
wait 60
take 05ABDC44
until 120 player->GetItemCount "bk_Boethiah's Glory_unique" >= 1
run
player->PositionCell -142 -300 651 0 "Caldera, Ghorak Manor"
until 600 "duma gro-lag"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk duma gro-lag
ask sculptor
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Boethiah == 40
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Boethiah == 60
bye
end

case da_boethiah_build
run
player->Position -60692 26800 303 0
wait 60
rest 600 - "Ex_DAE_Boethiah_fixed"->GetDisabled == 0
end

case da_boethiah_done
run
player->Position -70751 40300 539 0
wait 120
activate 053DD7C8
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Boethiah == 70
expect player->GetItemCount katana_goldbrand_unique == 1
end
